    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Describing the home",
     "texto": [
      "The definite forms **stua**, **kjøkkenet**, **badet** and **soverommet** usually mean «the living room», «the kitchen», «the bathroom» and «the bedroom»; the article is added to the end of the noun, unlike English «the».",
      "**Ryddig** means «tidy» and **rotete** «messy». **Rent** and **skittent** agree with neuter nouns such as **rommet**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
